{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51057","headline":"题冢上亭 · 吕岩","name":"题冢上亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冢上爲亭鬼莫嗔，冢头人即冢中人。\n凭兰莫起存亡意，除却虚空总是尘。\n（同前引《西溪丛语》。\n）（见《西溪丛语》卷上。\n）（〖1〗《西溪丛语》〖宋姚宽撰〗：「襄汉隐者躬耕数亩，因古冢爲亭，往来题诗甚富。\n」一日，柱间得一绝。\n相传吕翁作也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}